<title>USA: Daschle sess possible movement on budget accord.</title>
<headline>Daschle sess possible movement on budget accord.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senate Democratic Leader Tom Daschle said on Thursday he was encouraged by apparent movement towards an accord on the federal budget.</p>
<p>&quot;With the reports I've been getting in the last couple of days, there appears to be movement,&quot; Daschle told reporters.</p>
</text>
